--- !u!114 &-423436912253241447
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The Volume.</b> <i>GameObject \u203A Volume \u203A Global Volume</i>, named <i>Gas-Station Volume (global)</i>, with the profile <i>Gas-Station-Volume</i>. Add the override <b>Volumetric Fog</b>: <i>Enabled</i> on; <i>Distance</i> 100; <i>Base Height</i> 0, <i>Maximum Height</i> 16 (the fog thins out with height); <i>Density</i> 1; <i>Attenuation Distance</i> 15 (how far one sees through it); <i>Anisotropy</i> 0; <i>Scattering</i> 1; <i>Main Light</i> and <i>Additional Lights</i> contributions on; <i>Max Steps</i> 128; <i>Blur Iterations</i> 2."
